  "description_en": "Kv7 (KCNQ2/3) M-current: slow voltage-gated K⁺ channel (V_half=−38 mV, k=10 mV, tau_act~100 ms, g_max=0.5 nS) inhibited by Gq/11→PLCβ→PIP2 depletion. Regulates excitability, spike-frequency adaptation, and subthreshold resonance.",
  "description_zh": "Kv7（KCNQ2/3）M电流：慢电压门控K⁺通道（V_half=−38 mV，k=10 mV，tau_act~100 ms，g_max=0.5 nS），被Gq/11→PLCβ→PIP2耗竭所抑制。调节兴奋性、锋电位频率适应和阈下共振。"
